flowchart BT
    N0(Notify)
    N1{Load}
    N2([Fetch])
    N3(Retry fetch)
    N4([Notify fetch])
    N5[Validate]
    N6([Check])
    N7(Emit)
    N0 --> N1
    N1 --> N2
    N2 --> N3
    N2 --> N4
    N3 --> N5
    N3 --> N6
    N4 -->|fail| N7
    N0 --> N2
    N4 ==>|back| N3
    N7 -.->|rollback| N5
    N5 ==> N2
